TinyCrypt (SHA-256 only)

sha256.c, sha256.h, utils.c, utils.h, constants.h and LICENSE come from TinyCrypt 0.2.8
(https://github.com/intel/tinycrypt at commit 484f51f481483b999b22249055cb8bb7734149f6, the revision that
Zephyr's module zephyrproject-rtos/tinycrypt, used by NCS v2.5.1, is based on). LICENSE is unmodified; the
source files are unmodified except that their includes are relative ("sha256.h" in place of
<tinycrypt/sha256.h>), so they compile without include paths.

Copyright (c) 2017, Intel Corporation. BSD 3-Clause License (LICENSE; its second part, micro-ecc's licence,
covers code that is not included here).

ScouterKit's C++ library includes sha256.c and utils.c in src/g1/scouter_kit_g1.cpp (the asset IDs); the
g1v0 firmware uses the copy in NCS instead.
